# Normalise line endings. Files are stored LF in the repository and checked out
# LF on every platform, so Biome's formatter (which writes LF) agrees with the
# working tree on Windows as well as on the Linux CI runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lockfiles are generated; keep them out of diffs and merge conflicts.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated
